  "name": "Vini Vici",
  "entity_type": "duo",
  "description": "This year, psy-trance duo Vini Vici brought their collaborations with Hardwell, MR. BLACK and Liquid Soul (‘Crazy People 2026’), and HI-LO (‘Pump It Up’), along with many others to gigs around the world on a 40-plus-show tour from Greece to Belgium and further afield. In Belgium, one of Vini Vici’s most publicised moments of 2026 occurred when they closed the Library Stage alongside DJ RANYO, winner of an impromptu social media challenge by the festival. The pair also played EDC Korea and EDC Colombia this autumn.",
